---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Home Guides | Silken Valley Lifestyle"
  heroTitle="Home Guides"
  heroText="Practical advice and inspiration for creating a beautiful, comfortable, and well-organized home."
  heroCompact={true}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Home & Housekeeping</p>
    <h1>Home Guides & Household Resources</h1>
    <p>
      Discover practical household information, decorating inspiration,
      cleaning advice, and helpful ideas for maintaining an organized,
      welcoming, and comfortable home.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">
    <a class="card" href="#home-organization">
      <h3>Home Organization</h3>
      <p>Practical ideas for organizing rooms, cupboards, and everyday spaces.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#cleaning-housekeeping">
      <h3>Cleaning & Housekeeping</h3>
      <p>Cleaning routines, household care, and tips for maintaining a tidy home.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#laundry-fabric-care">
      <h3>Laundry & Fabric Care</h3>
      <p>Helpful information about washing, drying, stain removal, and fabrics.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#home-maintenance">
      <h3>Home Maintenance</h3>
      <p>Seasonal upkeep and practical advice for caring for your home.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#interior-decorating">
      <h3>Interior Decorating</h3>
      <p>Ideas for furnishings, accessories, room arrangements, and personal style.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#colour-paint">
      <h3>Colour & Paint</h3>
      <p>Explore colour palettes, paint finishes, and ways to refresh interior spaces.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#lighting">
      <h3>Lighting</h3>
      <p>Learn about ambient, task, and accent lighting throughout the home.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#furniture-layout">
      <h3>Furniture & Room Layout</h3>
      <p>Ideas for comfortable furniture arrangements and functional living spaces.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#storage-solutions">
      <h3>Storage Solutions</h3>
      <p>Make better use of cupboards, closets, shelving, and smaller spaces.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#seasonal-home-care">
      <h3>Seasonal Home Care</h3>
      <p>Household checklists and preparation for changing seasons.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#household-safety">
      <h3>Household Safety</h3>
      <p>General household safety, prevention, and everyday preparedness.</p>
    </a>

    <a class="card" href="#energy-efficiency">
      <h3>Energy & Water Efficiency</h3>
      <p>Practical ways to reduce household energy and water consumption.</p>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section id="home-organization" class="content-section">
    <h2>Home Organization</h2>
    <p>
      An organized home makes everyday routines easier and helps create
      a more peaceful living environment. Explore practical approaches
      to decluttering, arranging household belongings, and creating
      functional spaces that work for daily life.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="cleaning-housekeeping" class="content-section">
    <h2>Cleaning & Housekeeping</h2>
    <p>
      Discover useful cleaning methods, household routines, and practical
      housekeeping advice. From everyday tidying to deeper seasonal
      cleaning, small and consistent efforts can make a significant
      difference in the care of a home.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/housekeeping/">Explore Housekeeping</a></p>
  </section>

  <section id="laundry-fabric-care" class="content-section">
    <h2>Laundry & Fabric Care</h2>
    <p>
      Learn about fabric labels, washing temperatures, stain treatment,
      drying methods, and the proper care of everyday clothing and household
      linens. Understanding different fabrics can help preserve their
      appearance and extend their useful life.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="home-maintenance" class="content-section">
    <h2>Home Maintenance</h2>
    <p>
      Regular maintenance helps protect a home and keep household systems
      working properly. Find guidance on routine inspections, minor upkeep,
      seasonal maintenance, and recognizing when a repair requires
      professional assistance.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="interior-decorating" class="content-section">
    <h2>Interior Decorating</h2>
    <p>
      Create inviting interiors through thoughtful choices in furniture,
      textiles, artwork, accessories, and decorative details. Explore
      traditional and contemporary influences, room styling, and ways
      to bring character and harmony into your home.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/home-decor/">Explore Home Decor</a></p>
  </section>

  <section id="colour-paint" class="content-section">
    <h2>Colour & Paint</h2>
    <p>
      Colour influences the atmosphere and character of an interior.
      Explore colour relationships, complementary palettes, paint
      finishes, and ways to use colour to create rooms that feel
      balanced, welcoming, and individual.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="lighting" class="content-section">
    <h2>Lighting</h2>
    <p>
      Good lighting combines practicality with atmosphere. Learn how
      ambient lighting, task lighting, and accent lighting can work
      together to illuminate rooms, highlight architectural features,
      and create comfortable spaces.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="furniture-layout" class="content-section">
    <h2>Furniture & Room Layout</h2>
    <p>
      Thoughtful furniture placement can improve movement, comfort, and
      the overall appearance of a room. Explore ideas for arranging
      seating, defining living areas, balancing proportions, and making
      the most of available space.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="storage-solutions" class="content-section">
    <h2>Storage Solutions</h2>
    <p>
      Effective storage helps keep everyday belongings accessible while
      reducing clutter. Discover ideas for closets, cupboards, shelving,
      baskets, multi-purpose furniture, and creative storage in smaller
      homes.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="seasonal-home-care" class="content-section">
    <h2>Seasonal Home Care</h2>
    <p>
      Each season brings different household needs. Prepare your home
      throughout the year with practical checklists for spring cleaning,
      summer upkeep, autumn preparation, and winter care.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="household-safety" class="content-section">
    <h2>Household Safety</h2>
    <p>
      A safe home begins with awareness and preparation. Explore general
      information about fire prevention, safe storage, household hazards,
      emergency supplies, and simple precautions for everyday living.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="energy-efficiency" class="content-section">
    <h2>Energy & Water Efficiency</h2>
    <p>
      Small changes in household habits can help reduce unnecessary
      energy and water use. Explore practical approaches to efficient
      lighting, heating and cooling, water conservation, and responsible
      everyday consumption.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Explore More</h2>
    <p>
      Continue exploring practical ideas and inspiration throughout
      Silken Valley Lifestyle.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/housekeeping/">Housekeeping</a> |
      <a href="/home-decor/">Home Decor</a> |
      <a href="/resources/">All Resources</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
